      "items": [
        {
          "text": "It had been so long since the Recreance that Wyndle's kind were unsure how to form bonds, so the Ring acted as a committee to oversee the effort.",
          "revealedIn": [
            {
              "all": [
                { "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "i-9" },
                { "book": "edgedancer", "chapter": "2" }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wyndle was content in Shadesmar until the Ring picked him to bond someone in the physical world, a duty he resented. They also chose Lift for him, against his wishes, valuing her youth and her brush with the Old Magic. The bond proved easier than he expected, and in time he came to accept the assignment.",
          "revealedIn": [
            {
